      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "美股ETF：SPY日线；自定义收益标准差波动率模型(窗口10，年化√252)；空仓且 volatility>0 则满仓（Lean CustomVolatilityModel）"
    },
    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `CustomVolatilityModelAlgorithm.py`。`add_equity(\"SPY\",Daily)`；`set_volatility_model(CustomVolatilityModel(10))`：按日价比收益入 `RollingWindow(10)`，就绪后 `volatility=std*sqrt(252)`。`on_data`：未投资且 `volatility>0` → `set_holdings(\"SPY\",1)`。不是文档 CustomVolatility(3×21) 升降满仓/清仓核，也不是 ATR 吊灯核。提出日期未知。自定义收益标准差波动窗10年化；空仓且 volatility>0 满仓 ≠ 文档波动升满仓/降清仓（M2684）。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
    },
